Subject: [PATCH 9/9] marianos-azure-headless next: OR-24, a listing page parse
 and the page being recorded are put back once its product pages are read, so
 the other lane no longer replaces them before its records are built (R7 kept
 no product of Dog Food page 7 or Cat Treats page 2)

---
